# Room 0: Central Hub. The player starts here and travels to the themed rooms through doors.
# Door digits target a room index; the locked door 'U' (-> room 7, the fortress) needs a key
# found in one of the spoke rooms. Each spoke room has a '0' door that returns here.
# Doors sit on the ground so every one is reachable by walking.
name: Command Hub
gravity: 1400
